{"title":"Alabama Statewide High School Mathematics Contest","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p>The <b>Alabama Statewide High School Mathematics Contest</b> is a statewide mathematics exam for Alabama high school students.  These two hour examinations compare in difficulty to the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AMC_12\" title=\"AMC 12\">AMC 12</a>.  Past tests can be found at the contest website and make for excellent practice for problem solvers looking to sharpen their skills.\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Resources\">Resources</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Alabama_Statewide_High_School_Mathematics_Contest&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Resources\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://mcis.jsu.edu/mathcontest/\">Alabama Statewide High School Mathematics Contest website</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Alabama_mathematics_competitions\" title=\"Alabama mathematics competitions\">Alabama mathematics competitions</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mathematics_competition_resources\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Mathematics competition resources\">Mathematics competition resources</a></li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017192342\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.004 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.005 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 4/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 0/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 2/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    0.000      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in par